            <p class="mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600">Keep the sterile cotton pad firmly in place for 1 hour, apply an ice pack on your cheek intermittently, and choose cool soft foods like curd, milk, or lukewarm khichdi while the extraction site settles.</p>
